OL,3,GNEWSASenior councillor quits after
OL,4,Aclash over SEND plans
OL,5,
OL,6,FA senior councillor has resigned after
OL,7,Fclashing with his officers about
OL,8,Fprovision for children with special
OL,9,Feducational needs.
OL,11,FSam Journet has been the cabinet member
OL,12,Ffor education, SEND and skills at Essex
OL,13,FCounty Council since Reform UK took
OL,14,Fcontrol of the local authority in May.
OL,16,FIn a public letter addressed to the
OL,17,Fcouncil leader, he said his "focus"
OL,18,Fneeded to be on his new role, which he
OL,19,Fdescribed as leader of the opposition
OL,20,Fat Basildon Council.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
